{"type":"message","id":"7a313b9c","parentId":"bc5e0e82","timestamp":"2026-07-27T07:23:33.420Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户控制台显示的是 Kimi 的使用记录页面，所有请求都返回 403 状态码。这表示 API 密钥认证失败。\n\n403 通常意味着：\n1. API Key 无效或已过期\n2. API Key 被撤销\n3. 账户余额不足/欠费\n4. API Key 权限不足\n\n从截图看，请求来源包括：\n- Kimi Claw\n- myclaw\n- myhermes\n- cli-proxy-openai-co...\n\n模型列都显示 \"-\"，状态码全是 403。\n\n这很可能是 API Key 的问题。用户之前在 5月27日让我换过一个 API Key：\n\"把api key 换成这个sk-kimi-5DhAHezlaz9kpcRqjQjslnlj82Mgh88d4u4M8NJ4FyilBsZvOpY9Xmfa8cBQK87D\"\n\n我需要帮用户排查这个问题。先检查一下当前配置，看看 API Key 的状态。\n\n让我先检查 openclaw 的配置文件，看看 API key 是否配置正确。","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"403。API Key 认证失败。\n\n所有请求都被拒绝了。先排查配置。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool_24mmdK6ldbStkt06e1p3YPOh","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat /root/.openclaw/config.json 2>/dev/null | grep -i \"api\" | head -20"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool_ZmtK28HTJ74vGFSU3znCdKMS","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat /root/.openclaw/config.yaml 2>/dev/null | grep -i \"api\" | head -20"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"kimi-coding","model":"k2p6","usage":{"input":1127,"output":318,"cacheRead":35840,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":37285,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1785136996483}}
