{"type":"message","id":"04dcfde1","parentId":"e6857611","timestamp":"2026-07-27T07:24:36.711Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"我看到配置文件里 API Key 是 `sk-kimi-JpKtjTDppotc4hcImI7r6LTdWzG9VfKDOnBzLVT4i6iY4cgHF4JTAsjQujxVA9Xy`\n\n但用户之前让我换的 key 是 `sk-kimi-5DhAHezlaz9kpcRqjQjslnlj82Mgh88d4u4M8NJ4FyilBsZvOpY9Xmfa8cBQK87D`\n\n看起来当前配置里的 key 和之前用户让我换的不一致。但等等，我需要看看这个 key 是什么时候配置的。\n\n另外，403 也可能是因为：\n1. Key 本身被撤销/过期\n2. 账户欠费\n3. Key 没有调用权限\n\n让我先测试一下当前 key 是否有效。","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"配置里的 API Key 和之前你换的那个不一样。\n\n先测试当前 key 是否还有效。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool_S5D5FwHCy2aSEabPqLMEnUvE","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -o /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\" -H \"Authorization: Bearer sk-kimi-JpKtjTDppotc4hcImI7r6LTdWzG9VfKDOnBzLVT4i6iY4cgHF4JTAsjQujxVA9Xy\" \"https://agent-gw.kimi.com/coding/v1/models\" 2>/dev/null"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"kimi-coding","model":"k2p6","usage":{"input":488,"output":313,"cacheRead":39104,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":39905,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1785137056940}}
