{"type":"message","id":"9cd7183f","parentId":"9424aaa4","timestamp":"2026-07-27T07:24:53.550Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"当前 key 返回 200，说明 key 本身是有效的。那问题可能出在别的地方。\n\n让我再看看截图中的细节。截图显示请求来源有：\n- node\n- cli-proxy-openai-co...\n- Go-http-client/2.0\n- KimiCLI/1.3\n\n状态码全是 403，模型列全是 \"-\"。\n\n等等，这可能不是 openclaw 的 API key 问题，而是 kimi 平台的调用记录。用户在 kimi 的网页控制台看到了这些 403 记录。\n\n403 可能是：\n1. 模型被限制访问\n2. 并发/频率限制\n3. 账户额度问题\n\n让我检查一下 kimi 的 API 调用情况，或者看看是否有其他配置问题。\n\n另外，用户之前在 5月27日提到要把模型切换到 kimi 最新支持的模型。当前配置里模型是 k2p6，这可能是原因之一。\n\n让我再检查一下 openclaw 的日志，看看有没有更多错误信息。","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"当前 key 返回 200，key 本身有效。\n\n但控制台里所有请求都 403，模型列全是 \"-\"。这说明请求到达了网关，但模型调用被拒。\n\n查一下日志。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool_3FhQPeYp0xBpHQe7QdUg9Q0C","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls -la /root/.openclaw/logs/ | tail -10"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool_mBpdFxazhH6U2sSEREHXBThl","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -i \"403\\|error\\|fail\" /root/.openclaw/logs/*.log 2>/dev/null | tail -20"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"kimi-coding","model":"k2p6","usage":{"input":370,"output":309,"cacheRead":39552,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":40231,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1785137076903}}
