{"type":"message","id":"d35c9b14","parentId":"11648f5b","timestamp":"2026-07-27T07:25:14.954Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"日志里没有看到直接的 403 错误，但看到了 `missing scope: operator.read` 的 websocket 错误。这不是 API Key 的问题。\n\n再看一下截图中的信息。用户在 Kimi 网页控制台看到的是\"使用记录\"，所有请求都 403。请求来源包括 Kimi Claw、myclaw、myhermes 等。这实际上是 Kimi 平台对用户的调用统计。\n\n403 的可能原因：\n1. API Key 被撤销/过期 - 但我测试返回 200\n2. 模型访问权限问题 - 配置里的模型是 k2p6，可能这个模型不再可用\n3. 账户欠费/额度用完\n\n让我再看看 Kimi 目前支持什么模型，以及 k2p6 是否还有效。","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool_r8XpNZTTNs4e0inFQdJnmjFl","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer sk-kimi-JpKtjTDppotc4hcImI7r6LTdWzG9VfKDOnBzLVT4i6iY4cgHF4JTAsjQujxVA9Xy\" \"https://agent-gw.kimi.com/coding/v1/models\" 2>/dev/null | python3 -m json.tool 2>/dev/null | head -40"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"kimi-coding","model":"k2p6","usage":{"input":6190,"output":269,"cacheRead":39872,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46331,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1785137093619}}
