{"type":"message","id":"ed041a18","parentId":"2ec04088","timestamp":"2026-07-27T08:24:20.446Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The key returns `permission_error` - same issue as the `myhermes` key. This new key doesn't have access to the coding API endpoint either.\n\nLet me tell the user directly.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"这个 key 同样 `permission_error`。没有 coding API 权限。\n\n你申请的所有新 key 都有同样的问题。只有 `myclaw` 那个旧 key 有 coding API 权限，但额度用完了。\n\n需要确认：\n- 你是在 agent-gw.kimi.com/coding 申请的 key 吗\n- 还是 Kimi 的 coding API 现在需要额外开通/付费\n\n或者你可以：\n- 给 `myclaw` 充值恢复额度\n- 联系 Kimi 客服确认 coding API 的 key 申请方式"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"kimi-coding","model":"k2p6","usage":{"input":274,"output":154,"cacheRead":76160,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":76588,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1785140652358}}
