{"type":"message","id":"d234a3b0","parentId":"b0162982","timestamp":"2026-07-27T08:26:31.329Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户要求更新 Kimi Claw 插件到最新版，然后用新 key 走 api.kimi.com。\n\n我需要：\n1. 先检查当前 Kimi Claw 插件的版本\n2. 更新插件\n3. 修改配置，把 base_url 改成 api.kimi.com\n4. 测试新 key\n\n先看看当前插件怎么安装的，以及版本。","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool_bePV8iLWzjfI9pqfddiBJs11","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls -la /root/.openclaw/extensions/kimi-claw/ 2>/dev/null"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool_zmdUIUh6HG0lQK4wq3hASSMJ","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat /root/.openclaw/extensions/kimi-claw/package.json 2>/dev/null | grep -i version"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool_vgDO5kqr1MX1HK3D2c3nLKBA","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat /root/.openclaw/extensions/kimi-claw/openclaw.plugin.json 2>/dev/null"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"kimi-coding","model":"k2p6","usage":{"input":677,"output":182,"cacheRead":76544,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":77403,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1785140782245}}
