{"type":"message","id":"668c843d","parentId":"970886e3","timestamp":"2026-07-27T08:27:09.463Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"npm 查询还在运行。让我继续。这个插件看起来是 Kimi 官方维护的，可能不是通过 npm 公开的。\n\n让我换个思路：\n1. 看看 kimi-claw 的 dist 目录里有什么，能不能找到更新逻辑\n2. 或者直接尝试用 clawhub 或 npm 搜索\n3. 或者检查 Kimi 官网是否有新版插件下载\n\n实际上，从之前的测试结果来看：\n- `api.kimi.com/coding/v1/messages` 返回 `Kimi Claw version incompatible` —— 这说明 api.kimi.com 有新的认证/协议要求\n- 但 agent-gw.kimi.com/coding 还是可以用的（旧 key 可以访问）\n\n等等，让我重新想一下。用户之前说新 key 走 api.kimi.com 需要新版插件。但我测试新 key 走 agent-gw.kimi.com/coding 也返回 permission_error。这说明新 key 本身没有 coding API 权限。\n\n那新版插件能解决什么问题？可能新版插件能：\n1. 自动处理 api.kimi.com 的认证\n2. 或者新版插件支持新的 key 申请方式\n\n但无论如何，如果 key 本身没有权限，换 endpoint 也没用。\n\n让我先尝试更新插件看看有没有新版本。可能这个插件不在 npm 上，是 Kimi 内部维护的。","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool_UrFtyiq52USQxV9tiYikiUq3","name":"process","arguments":{"action":"kill","sessionId":"grand-orbit"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool_z6KhBqmD7jt8U2UYbusVfSOC","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://api.github.com/repos/kimi-ai/kimi-claw/releases/latest\" 2>/dev/null | python3 -c \"import sys,json; d=json.load(sys.stdin); print('version:', d.get('tag_name', 'not found'))\" 2>/dev/null || echo \"no github repo\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool_5b7ZPGVvGxzTKkPSEoubC6rq","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls /root/.openclaw/extensions/kimi-claw/dist/ 2>/dev/null"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"kimi-coding","model":"k2p6","usage":{"input":630,"output":412,"cacheRead":78656,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":79698,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1785140810030}}
